5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The current rotation is failing. We need data on actual time spent before committing to a year.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I agree. It feels unfair when the same people do the work. Let's check usage patterns.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I worry about conflict. We need a system that keeps us on speaking terms, not just clean rooms.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know the costs. Who is paying for the bleach and bags right now?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
