35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The data is clear. A full pass takes over an hour. That is a significant block of time.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, that matches what I saw. Two people are away often, but three people make almost all the kitchen mess.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The chat logs show that conflict starts with reminders. The previous tenants' note says permanent division led to silence.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Victoria, that is worrying. The receipts show we spend 2,300 yen monthly on supplies, often buying duplicates.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The grout is back to black in eleven days. The chat shows we only talk when things are already wrong.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Rin, 2,300 yen is low. The real cost is the hour I lose. I need to know if outsourcing saves that hour.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, if we outsource, the time cost disappears. But the usage data shows the mess is concentrated.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, if the mess is concentrated, a shared rotation might feel unfair to the clean people.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Victoria, the management rate is 4,200 yen an hour. That is nearly double our supply cost.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
