47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, a usage-based system requires tracking. The chat logs show we hate tracking. It creates friction.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Victoria, I agree. But I need to know who pays. The rate sheet says one person collects. That is risky.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Rin, I just want the room to be the same every day. I don't care who pays, as long as it works.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
