51,2,4,talk,Mio,,I am leaning toward a usage-based rotation. I need to see if the firm's terms allow for partial service.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I am leaning toward a fixed rotation with a social check-in. I need to avoid the silence the previous tenants had.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,I am leaning toward outsourcing. I need to know the exact monthly cost and who is liable for the bill.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I am leaning toward outsourcing. I need the grout to stay clean. I need the state to be predictable.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
